1
00:00:00,958 --> 00:00:03,798
(Penny:)Maybe some of us
should stop talking altogether.

2
00:00:04,754 --> 00:00:07,924
(Waiter:)-How is everything tonight?
-Really uncomfortable.

3
00:00:11,469 --> 00:00:14,969
The best thing about a monogamous,
mutually supportive relationship...

4
00:00:15,139 --> 00:00:17,139
...is even if you have different ideas...

5
00:00:17,308 --> 00:00:21,768
(Leonard:)...you can have a spirited debate,
yet still care for, even make love--

6
00:00:25,399 --> 00:00:26,439
You want your fish?

7
00:00:30,154 --> 00:00:32,904
Knew you were gonna do that.
Doesn't make me psychic.

8
00:00:35,576 --> 00:00:38,616
(Leonard:)Attaboy, Leonard. Make it worse.

9
00:00:39,413 --> 00:00:41,543
[SINGING]
American woman

10
00:00:41,707 --> 00:00:44,377
Listen what I say

11
00:00:47,088 --> 00:00:48,588
(Leonard:)What's going on?

12
00:00:49,507 --> 00:00:51,427
(Sheldon:)We scored.

13
00:00:52,677 --> 00:00:54,677
(Sheldon:)I'm the wingman.

14
